rule base pausing where

-- Hands control to the prompt where an author wrote a placeholder, instead of
-- elaborating it. The shipped base has two clauses for a hole and both have
-- empty bodies, so a declaration left with one is refused; this one yields.
--
-- MS12 phase 309 (`~4qgxx`) is what reaches it from inside a module load.

rule elaborate t :- when focus-is-hole (surface-is-placeholder t)
  do yield "a placeholder: fill it and `yield` to carry on"
